{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>El, in nefesh</b> — in their desire, with contempt, in nefesh." "<b>Veyafeach</b> — speaks falsehood [literally: breathes out violence], like: yafiach."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra explains the phrase אל בנפש in Psalms 27:12 by parsing it idiomatically; the exact syntactic logic is characteristically compressed."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:45.681859928Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}